---
layout: base.njk
title: Now
description: "What’s NoGood currently up to."
bodyColor: bg-dark

date: 2026-10-27
---

<div class="section bg-dark">
    <div class="section-column pixel-font uppercase">
        <h1>
            NOW / What’s up?
        </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="spacer-large"></div>
</div>
<div id="now" class="section medium-grid bg-dark">
    {# NOW #}
    <div class="section-column sticky-two-rows">
        <div class="sticky-wrapper">
            <div class="sticky">
                <p class="text-extra-large">
                    I launched a <a href="https://www.patreon.com/bynogood" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="patreon-click" data-umami-event-location="now-intro">Patreon</a> (!) and since then it has occupied my mind constantly. Relentlessly. I’m figuring out what I’m comfortable sharing, in a way that’s manageable for me and (hopefully) interesting to you. Naturally, I’ve already started overengineering the whole thing in Obsidian.
                </p>
                <div class="spacer"></div>
                <p class="text-large">
                    Client work has been quiet since I finished the artwork for TABConf’s final conference, so I’m focussing on promoting <a href="/the-nogood-book/">The NoGood Book</a> and writing about what I learned from self-publishing it.
                </p>
                <div class="spacer"></div>
                <p class="text-large">
                    I’m also looking into starting a print club. For now, that means researching printers, cutters and laminating machines. My recent experiments with AI have been quite disappointing, and I’m looking forward to working with my hands again and making actual, physical things.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="note bg-offwhite padding-small place-bottom">
            <p>Last updated {{ date | postDate }} — Inspired by
                <a href="https://nownownow.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NowNowNow</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-column">
        <div
            class="sticky">
            {# ON REPEAT #}
            <h4 class="uppercase pixel-font">On repeat</h4>
            <div class="spacer-large"></div>
            <p>
                I know you’re all here for my J-Pop and K-R&B recommendations, so here you go. I’m mostly listening to
                <a href="https://wavy.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wavy</a>
                productions at the moment.
            </p>
            <div class="list two-col-list">
                <div class="">
                    offonoff
                </div>
                <div class="align-right">
                    <a
                        href="https://open.spotify.com/album/4crHesv3PHfci2PBJ6m9sj?si=hFoQW6sSSseX36M5w7Z7xw"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="icon external-icon">boy.</a>
                </div>
                <div class="row-border"></div>
                <div class="">
                    Jiwoo
                </div>
                <div class="align-right">
                    <a
                        href="https://open.spotify.com/album/2StiuLAAy7E3K40AhzZefp?si=H-qvUGLpQqKmuZigTkTSBg"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="icon external-icon">Esprit</a>
                </div>
                <div class="row-border"></div>
                <div class="">
                    Colde
                </div>
                <div class="align-right">
                    <a
                        href="https://open.spotify.com/album/7evVSYUhQhpzygBaKYk1jH?si=D3B5P_ECRKKANv4H3xQiSQ"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="icon external-icon">Love Part 2</a>
                </div>
                <div class="row-border"></div>
                <div class="">
                    Zion.T
                </div>
                <div class="align-right">
                    <a
                        href="https://open.spotify.com/album/0T3dxtCegtw8C07ZMvwIfv?si=kIZOOMEiS26X81-r1T0d9Q"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="icon external-icon">Zip</a>
                </div>
                <div class="row-border"></div>
                <div class="">
                    E SENS
                </div>
                <div class="align-right">
                    <a
                        href="https://open.spotify.com/album/2A5ezsGN5jDoCwGQytDJ1I"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="icon external-icon">Jeogeumtong</a>
                </div>
                <div class="row-border"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="spacer line"></div>
            {# LATEST NOSTR NOTE #}
            <div>
                <h4 class="uppercase pixel-font">Latest note</h4>
                <div class="spacer-large"></div>
                <div id="latest-nostr-note"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="spacer line"></div>
            {# RECENT SUPPORTERS #}
            <div class="">
                <h4 class="uppercase pixel-font">Recent supporters</h4>
                <div class="spacer-large"></div>
                <div id="home-zap-feed" class="zap-feed animate-in"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-column">
        <div class="sticky">
            <h4 class="uppercase pixel-font">Latest on Patreon</h4>
            <div class="spacer-large"></div>
            <div class="media-list now-patreon-posts">
                {% for post in patreonPosts %}
                    {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
                        <article class="outline padding-small now-patreon-post">
                            {% if loop.index <= 2 %}
                                <div class="zoom no-blend now-patreon-post-header">
                                    <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="patreon-click" data-umami-event-location="now-post-image">
                                        {% image post.image, post.title, [480, 960], "(min-width: 1280px) 30vw, (min-width: 769px) 25vw, 100vw" %}
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="patreon-click" data-umami-event-location="now-post-title">{{ post.title }}</a>
                                {% if post.intro %}<p>{{ post.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
                                <span class="text-small text-tabular">{{ post.publishedAt | postDate }}</span>
                            {% else %}
                                <div class="patreon-post-compact">
                                    <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="patreon-post-thumbnail no-blend" data-umami-event="patreon-click" data-umami-event-location="now-post-image">
                                        {% image post.image, post.title, [256], "48px" %}
                                    </a>
                                    <div class="patreon-post-info">
                                        <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="patreon-click" data-umami-event-location="now-post-title">{{ post.title }}</a>
                                        <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                        <span class="text-small text-tabular">{{ post.publishedAt | postDate }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </article>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/zap-feed.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/nostr-note.js"></script>